  "description": "WELCOME HOME<br/>Positioned in a convenient Maylands location, this well-located apartment offers easy, low-maintenance living close to local cafés, shops, public transport and everyday amenities. Featuring a renovated kitchen and practical layout, the home is ideal for tenants seeking a connected lifestyle in one of Perth's most vibrant inner-city suburbs.<br/><br/>WHY YOU'LL LOVE LIVING HERE<br/>/ Comfortable apartment living in a well-connected Maylands pocket.<br/>/ Practical layout suited to relaxed everyday living.<br/>/ Easy-care design ideal for low-maintenance living.<br/>/ Convenient location close to cafés, shops and public transport.<br/>/ Great base for city workers, students or anyone seeking strong local connectivity.<br/>/ Positioned within easy reach of the Maylands café strip and train station.<br/><br/>THE NEIGHBOURHOOD<br/>Maylands is loved for its vibrant café culture, local dining, boutique shopping and excellent transport links. With the Maylands train station, river foreshore, parks and nearby lifestyle precincts all within easy reach, this location offers the perfect balance of convenience and character.<br/><br/>THE OPPORTUNITY<br/>A practical and well-located rental in a popular Maylands pocket. Ideal for tenants seeking a low-maintenance apartment with excellent access to transport, cafés, shopping and the Perth CBD. Register your interest today to arrange a viewing.<br/><br/>IMPORTANT INFORMATION<br/>/ Unfurnished. One or more images in this listing may include staging furniture, digital enhancements or virtual styling for advertising purposes. The property's actual condition, features, dimensions and finishes may differ from what is shown and should be confirmed at inspection.<br/>/ Initial lease term of 12 months preferred.<br/>/ Available 26 June 2026.<br/>/ Utilities: Tenants are responsible for connecting utilities.<br/>/ Communal laundry facilities available for tenant use.<br/>/ Applications: Apply via edisonproperty.com.au. Applications will not be assessed until after a scheduled home open. Applicants must view the property at a scheduled home open or private inspection before an application will be processed. Register to inspect via the listing to receive inspection details and notifications.<br/><br/>For further information please contact Lauren Smith 0433 533 391.<br/><br/>LANDLORD / INVESTOR ENQUIRIES<br/>Are you a current landlord or a new investor? To learn more about Edison Property's property management services, please contact our Business Development Manager, Alma Elliot, at alma@edisonproperty.com.au or call 0452 507 856.",
